      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This invention details a modular semiconductor interconnect assembly featuring a multi-layered substrate architecture for thermal management. Novelty centers on the integration of a logic-gate controlled switching matrix within the structure. Key components include a lateral conductive pathway for signal transmission between dies, coupled with a thermal dissipation interface utilizing micro-vias. Furthermore, the design incorporates dielectric isolation layers and a synchronized clocking mechanism across high-density interconnect pins.",
      "source": "target",
